## Recommended work order (when choosing “what next”)

```
1) User-facing ledger correctness still unconfirmed?
   → Period Management verify (handoff fixture) BEFORE big refactors

2) Else tech harden for internal ship quality?
   → tsc 정리부터 (batch) → then drop ignoreBuildErrors

3) Ops / roles when accounts exist?
   → Payroll-only smoke, then employee login

4) Only when user explicitly starts public product?
   → Track B (tenancy → auth → onboarding → harden API)

5) Nice-to-have modules?
   → HR leave / WorkCover / audit IDB / AR-AP journals
```

## Do not

- Start Track B because “only public is left” — that is false  
- Mix homepage (`selpic2`) webpack with accounting  
- Treat ignoreBuildErrors as permanent forever without a cleanup plan  

